LanguageData.CC_Journey_AskText:
It is {0}, the hour the travellers were to set off for {1}, but not everyone is ready:

{2}

The others wait at the gate. Wait an hour for them, leave without them, or call the journey off?

LanguageData.CC_Journey_AskTextDanger:
It is {0}, the hour the travellers were to set off for {1}, but there is danger on the map:

{2}

They wait at the gate. Wait an hour, set off anyway, or call the journey off?
